{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987200/extras/767ae72add36da1eff2e59a22277baec.avif?t=1756814356\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Some villages don't appear on maps.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >American documentary filmmaker Calvin Walker is forced to seek shelter in a remote, misty part of Turkey when his path is blocked. He finds a nearby village \u2014 but this place is far from ordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silent homes, cold yet kind faces, dark secrets buried in the past...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was meant to be a short stay quickly turns into a disturbing realization: nothing is as it seems. And now, escaping isn't just about finding a road \u2014 it's a fight for salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven, single-player psychological horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic narration and atmospheric environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense missions and character-focused dialogues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark village setting in the early 2000s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local elements inspired by Turkish horror culture</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready?</strong> <br><i>When the line between reality and illusion blurs, the only escape is to confront it. </i><br><i>But... not every truth is meant for everyone.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987200?t=1756814356","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3987200?t=1756814356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987200/c6915aa6e4fa537f820ed7724b8db99c26a5696f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756814356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987200/c6915aa6e4fa537f820ed7724b8db99c26a5696f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756814356","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains mature content that may not be suitable for all audiences. It features scenes of psychological horror, disturbing imagery, and mild violence. Some moments may include blood, unsettling sounds, and intense atmospheric tension. There is no sexual content or drug use, but the overall tone may be emotionally distressing to some players."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987200/extras/767ae72add36da1eff2e59a22277baec.avif?t=1756814356\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Some villages don't appear on maps.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >American documentary filmmaker Calvin Walker is forced to seek shelter in a remote, misty part of Turkey when his path is blocked. He finds a nearby village \u2014 but this place is far from ordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silent homes, cold yet kind faces, dark secrets buried in the past...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was meant to be a short stay quickly turns into a disturbing realization: nothing is as it seems. And now, escaping isn't just about finding a road \u2014 it's a fight for salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven, single-player psychological horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic narration and atmospheric environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense missions and character-focused dialogues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark village setting in the early 2000s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local elements inspired by Turkish horror culture</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready?</strong> <br><i>When the line between reality and illusion blurs, the only escape is to confront it. </i><br><i>But... not every truth is meant for everyone.</i></p>","developers":["CryVoltaStudio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3932980","name":"Whisper Village"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987200/e3d9ed09f82fa8e82683c477c284ee313cec5e7b/header.jpg?t=1756814356","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257188825,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188825/movie480.mp4?t=1756811697","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188825/movie_max.mp4?t=1756811697"},"name":"Whisper Village Trailer(2)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257188825/81d4081ecca08fd4a8cf3dc6e263bd036f210801/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756811697","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188825/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756811697","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188825/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756811697"}}],"name":"Whisper